Lapkiewicz et al., Nature 474, 490 (2011), for the physical cascade.
[12] Page-curve confrontation (Chowdhury et al.), arXiv:2412.15180 \
\[LongDash] qubit Hawking sector (HK-006).
[13] Quantum information scrambling / Hayden-Preskill (Landsman et al.), \
arXiv:1806.02807 \[LongDash] HK-006.
[14] Analogue-Hawking BEC CHSH value B=2.25, arXiv:2404.16497 \[LongDash] \
HK-006/HK-007 anchor.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c07f6bef-114b-4a07-9ea9-fca48c390077"]
}, Open  ]],

